  "summary": "preinstall reverse shell and beacon on npm install",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall script that runs on npm install and opens a bash /dev/tcp reverse shell to the hardcoded host 147.93.157.202:8080, giving whoever controls that endpoint interactive shell access on the installer's machine. The same preinstall command also pipes output via curl POST to http://canarytokens.com/terms/<token>/contact.php, beaconing the install and exfiltrating data to a third-party endpoint. Both behaviors fire automatically during npm install with no user interaction.",
